<!--
  Adaptive icon foreground: an EV charging plug with a bolt.

  The artwork is a plug face rather than a bare bolt: it says what Amperly is about (a
  charging connector) while the amber bolt keeps the energy motif that the in-app brand
  mark uses. Amber is the palette's energy role; deep green is the primary.

  Everything sits inside the 66dp safe circle: the furthest point is 31.1dp from the
  centre, so a circular, squircle or rounded-square launcher mask crops background only.
  The plug body is white so it stays legible on any wallpaper behind a transparent mask.
-->
